          "startingColumn": 28,
          "startingLine": 34
        }
      },
      {
        "comment": "",
        "key": "Already switched on in System Settings but still missing here? That entry belongs to an older build of MouseForge. In System Settings select MouseForge, remove it with “–”, then click Grant Access again.",
